## Critical Rules
- ALWAYS use Next.js 15 Route Handlers (not API Routes)
- ALWAYS validate request parameters and body
- ALWAYS implement proper error handling with appropriate status codes
- ALWAYS use TypeScript interfaces for request and response data
- ALWAYS follow RESTful API conventions for endpoints
- NEVER expose sensitive information in responses
- ORGANIZE route handlers by resource type
- USE consistent response formats for all endpoints 